      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "flight controller / firmware / integration / comms + telem\n    me\n    fcu firmware + pcb\n    (maybe?) esc firmware\n    (maybe?) sensor firmware\nmotors + escs\n    pick motor\n    pick esc\nsensors (imu, alt/height, possibly motor encoders)\n    sensor selection\n    sensor board(s)\n    sensor firmware?\nbattery + bms\n    battery selection\n    bms selection / board\nvision\n    vision processor, board\nchassis\n    integration w/ rest of systems\n    custom chassis",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "flight controller / firmware / integration / comms + telem\n    me\n    fcu firmware + pcb\n    (maybe?) esc firmware\n    (maybe?) sensor firmware\nmotors + escs\n    pick motor\n    pick esc\nsensors (imu, alt/height, possibly motor encoders)\n    sensor selection\n    sensor board(s)\n    sensor firmware?\nbattery + bms\n    battery selection\n    bms selection / board\nvision\n    vision processor, board\nchassis\n    integration w/ rest of systems\n    custom chassis",
